One model picker (T6): slots in T3's picker for the account row (renderInstanceDetail), the footer's
Usage details (ComposerPickerFooter children, onUsageLimitsCommand), and on mobile the sheet grouped by
provider with account rows (BatonAccountRow), the session's real effort, and the header's limit chip.

